WEBVTT

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.530
Damn! I won't lose to you, Tetsuo!

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:08.060
You can't beat <i>me</i>!

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.620
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:13.560
Damn!

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.660
A cat!

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:25.060
Later, Yuma!

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:28.130
That guy...

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:29.800
Huh?

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.420
Out of my way, out of my way! Out of my way! Get out of my way!

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.170
Please get out of my way!

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.870
Hey, that hurt, you!

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:42.560
Wow!

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:42.900
Huh?

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.560
Yuma Tsukumo-<i>kun</i>!

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.190
Aren't you the champion of the W.D.C., Yuma Tsukumo-<i>kun</i>?

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:50.400
Huh?

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.400
I am a huge fan of you, Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:55.720
Ohh... I see.

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:00.330
Wait, this ain't the time for this! I'm gonna be late!

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.180
I won't let that happen!

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:04.960
I can't let the crown jewel of the city, Yuma-<i>kun</i> the Duel Champion,

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:07.540
go to class late!

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:09.800
Over here!

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:12.320
Along here!

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:14.520
Over here!

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:16.400
Hurry up!

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:21.860
Here, here.

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:24.460
Here, here.

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:27.060
Here, here.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:32.270
Ta-da~! Sorry we kept you all waiting!

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:33.320
Huh?!

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:34.030
Wh-What the?

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:40.370
I brought the crown jewel of the school, Yuma Tsukumo-<i>kun</i>!

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.200
See?

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.000
Yu... Yuma?

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.780
Wh-What on Earth happened to you?

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:51.290
Oh, I'm a bit late.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:54.210
I transferred to this class starting today.

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:55.300
The name's Rei Shingetsu.

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:00.510
Pleased to meet everyone!

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:04.310
That aside, the both of you are late.

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:10.500
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:16.470
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:19.180
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:31.530
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:34.610
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:39.120
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.490
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:44.710
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:49.250
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:51.380
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.090
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:56.550
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:59.600
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:02.060
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:08.100
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.860
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:12.320
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:17.030
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:26.080
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:41.280
Man, that transfer student put me through hell.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.740
What's up with that guy...?

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:50.620
What's wrong with it?
 He's your fan, Yuma, so you should get along!

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:50.580
"It's For the Best While I'm Here!
 My Name Is Rei Shingetsu"

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.290
Listen, you!

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.500
An autograph, please!

00:03:58.170 --> 00:03:58.800
What the?

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.630
Everyone, calm down.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.680
Who... Who's that guy?

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:08.510
Now, enjoy the Dueling!

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:12.640
Don't you know? He's the Pro Duelist Daisuke Katagiri.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.150
Pro Duelist?

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.690
He is going to give special classes.

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.860
You can really Duel with the pro, Katagiri?

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:23.360
I-is that true? Aw, hell yeah!

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:28.700
Wow, a Pro Duelist?! I bet he's strong!

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:30.290
Huh?

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:36.040
A Pro Duelist... That has struck my curiosity.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:39.340
Yuma Tsukumo... Yuma Tsukumo...

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.920
How will I get him?

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.300
Hm?

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.260
Who's that?

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.310
Hey! You!

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:51.770
I got something to ask you.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.480
My turn! Draw!

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.480
I activate my Magic!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:00.150
Trap Card, open!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:05.360
That must be nice for them all! I wanna do it, too!

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.780
Of course they are.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.030
That's pretty good!

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:14.750
Here I go! I'll attack you all directly with Ben Kei!

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.050
Don't whine!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:30.140
Yes, enjoy the Dueling!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.230
Sorry, but Dueling for today is finished.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:39.610
Enjoy the Dueling, now!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:43.230
Man, that Pro Duelist is awesome!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.190
To think he could take the match in that one turn...

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:49.700
Man, I wanna Duel the Pro Duelist Katagiri, too!

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:52.620
Got it, Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.620
Leave the Duel with the Pro Katagiri to me!

00:05:57.670 --> 00:05:59.920
Shingetsu here will get it done for you!

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.760
Hey, wait, Shingetsu! Shingetsu!

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:10.890
I am so great at Dueling, as usual.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:11.300
Yo!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:19.900
Sorry, pal, but can you sign this card for me?

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:29.320
That's strange. Shouldn't he have come back by now?

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:33.780
There he is!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.240
Pro Katagiri!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.210
Please wait, Pro Katagiri!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:43.170
Thank goodness... I actually have to ask you for a favor.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:48.550
I would like to ask you to Duel the student named Yuma Tsukumo.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:51.220
Yuma Tsukumo?!

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.890
Shingetsu-<i>kun</i>!

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.350
Shingetsu!

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:56.890
That's enough! Let's go home already!

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.310
We can't do that!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:02.360
Yuma, Shingetsu-<i>kun</i> is likely trying to find the Pro, Katagiri, for you!

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.230
Nobody even asked him to!

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:07.610
That voice is...!

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.070
Tell me where Yuma Tsukumo is this instant!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.530
I can't say!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:19.040
It's for the best, so I won't tell!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.710
Then I'll just beat you to a pulp!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.710
Take that! Direct Attack!

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:37.890
This hotblooded lecture's far from over!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.180
Shingetsu!

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.310
Hey, Shingetsu! Shingetsu!

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:49.530
I'm sorry, Yuma-<i>kun</i>... I thought it was for the best...

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.280
Shingetsu...

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.410
What did you do to Shingetsu?!

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.160
Are you Yuma Tsukumo?

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:03.750
That stupid brat there wouldn't tell me your whereabouts, so I gave him a hotblooded lecture.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.170
That is...

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.090
...Barian!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:12.550
Yuma Tsukumo, I'm going to
 bury you with the power of Barian!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:14.590
Interesting!

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:18.680
I don't care if it's Barian or whatever! I'll crush it!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.350
Duel Disk, set!

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:26.610
D-Gazer, set!

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:30.230
<i>AR-Vision: Link established</i>.

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:32.820
Duel!!

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.530
That is going well.

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:39.290
Those Numbers are mine now.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:43.500
I'll go first! My turn! Draw!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:47.750
Yuma, the power of the Chaos Xyz is still unknown to us.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.050
And we don't know his style.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:49.960
I know that.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:54.470
I activate the Magic Card, Three Card Summon!

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:58.970
It there are three Level Four or lower Monster Cards with the same level in my hand,

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:01.720
I can Special Summon one of them.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.900
I Special Summon the Level Three Rai Rider!

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:08.610
Appear, Rai Rider!

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.900
Then I Summon Zubaba Knight!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:18.530
And when I have Level Three Monsters on my field,

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.280
I can Special Summon this guy!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.540
Come, Mimimic!

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:29.130
I Overlay the three Level Three Monsters!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:33.420
I build the Overlay Network!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.170
Xyz Summon!

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.640
Come forth, Number 34!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:43.060
Electronic Computer Beast Tera-Byte!

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.850
It's Tera-Byte!

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.560
He Summoned a Number on his <i>first</i> turn!

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.480
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:55.690
If you've got enough foolish willpower to oppose Barian so persistently,

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.780
you're gonna get a hotblooded lecture!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.780
My turn! Draw!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:04.870
I activate the Field Magic Study Kingdom - Training World!

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:17.220
With the effect of this Field Magic, I can send two Monster Cards from my hand to the Graveyard,

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:21.930
to Summon a Level Seven or higher Monster from my hand without release!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:25.140
Come, Hotblooded Beast King Bearman!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.310
Level Eight!

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:31.150
Then, when I have Bearman on my field,

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:34.230
I activate the Magic Card, Bear's Boot Camp!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:39.320
I can Special Summon a Lovell Four Beast-Warrior-Type Monster from my deck!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:42.200
Come, Hotblooded Beast Master, Wolfbark!

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:47.960
I'm not finished! The effect of Wolfbark activates!

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:52.130
Once per turn, I can Special Summon
 another one from the Graveyard!

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:54.210
Come, Wolfbark!

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.960
Three Monsters that quick...

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.430
I'm not done! The hotblooded lecture is just beginning!

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.390
I activate the effect of Bearman!

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:07.520
The levels of all Level Four or lower Beast-Warrior-Type Monsters on my field

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.690
are doubled until the end of the turn!

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:12.730
The level of the Wolfbarks change from four to eight!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.820
Here I come, Yuma Tsukumo!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:20.820
I Overlay my Level Eight Bearman and the two Wolfbarks!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.700
I build the Overlay Network with these three Monsters!

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:26.910
Xyz Summon!

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:32.500
Show yourself, Hotblooded Coach King Giantrainer!

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.210
Hotblooded Coach King Giantrainer's effect activates!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:44.180
I detach one Overlay Unit to make both
 players shuffle their own deck!

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.020
Then we each draw!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:54.900
That card is sent to the Graveyard, and if it is a Monster Card,

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:58.150
the one with the lower level receives 800 points damage!

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.490
Very well!

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:00.740
Here we go!

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:01.820
- Draw!
 - Draw!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:06.580
The one I drew is Level Eight!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:10.290
I got a Level One.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.540
Then take 800 damage!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.050
I'm not finished!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:24.010
I detach another Overlay Unit, and we both shuffle our decks!

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:29.850
Again?!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:30.520
Here goes!

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:31.730
- Draw!
 - Draw!

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:35.190
I have a Level Eight Monster!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:39.400
I have... a Level Three.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:43.110
Then take 800 damage!

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:48.580
Yuma!

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:54.710
Now, I detach the last Overlay Unit,
 and we both shuffle our decks!

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:57.330
Here goes!

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:59.130
Draw!

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:03.840
My Monster is Level Four.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:06.090
Now, show me your card!

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:10.350
My card is... Level Six!

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.810
What?!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.110
Didn't break a sweat!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.360
The match is still on!

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:29.120
I went through the trouble of
 giving you a hotblooded lecture...

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:34.620
It seems that you need it carved into your flesh!

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.040
Yuma, it's coming!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:46.760
From my hand, I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Barian's Force!

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:55.060
With this card, I can Rank-Up my Xyz Monster and Special Summon a Chaos Xyz!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:14:00.020
I rebuild the Overlay Network with Giantrainer!

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.860
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.700
The power of Barian, born inside the chaos...

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:13.410
Cast your judgment on this filthy world!

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:16.750
Appear!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:22.000
Chaos Xyz: Hot-Blooded Coach God Ultimatrainer!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.220
So the Chaos Xyz came!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:35.180
Then the effect of Barian's Force activates!

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:41.860
The Overlay Units of one opposing 
Xyz Monster all are absorbed!

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.570
Chaos Drain!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:50.860
With this, Ultimatrainer has four Chaos Overlay Units!

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:54.830
Let the real hotblooded lecture begin!

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.620
Go, Ultimatrainer!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:01.250
Blow up Tera-Byte!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:06.920
Tera-Byte is...

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.050
Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:12.260
There's more! Ultimatrainer's effect activates!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:17.640
By detaching one Chaos Overlay Unit, the opposing player draws one card!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:22.440
Then, if that card is a Level Four or lower Monster,

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.820
he gets the Attack Power of that card as damage!

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:29.070
I will detach all four Chaos Overlay Units!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:31.070
Ultimate Trial!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:40.000
You have to draw a card four times.

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:43.920
Now, get buried by your own Monsters!

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.090
Draw!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:58.270
I drew Achacha Archer, a Level Three.

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:02.810
Level Three?! Then receive it's Attack Power as damage!

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:10.490
Y-Yuma-<i>kun</i>...

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:13.660
The drawn card is sent to the Graveyard.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:17.950
Now draw your next card! Draw it!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.370
Yuma...

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.870
I won't lose this!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:23.370
Draw!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.380
It's the Magic Card, Wonder Wand!

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:34.510
But you still have to draw two times. Draw!

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:36.050
Draw!

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.100
I drew the Level Four Kagetokage.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:53.700
Now you only have 100 Life remaining!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:57.030
Now, it's your last draw!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.120
Please, stop it!

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:58.740
Huh?

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:01.250
I will do anything...

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.750
So just leave Yuma-<i>kun</i>...

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.210
Please let him off the hook!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.420
You idiot! What are you talking about, Shingetsu?!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.420
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, please run away!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.090
Shingetsu...

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.930
You pulling this "Friendship is magic" bull?

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:19.010
But he's still a loser regardless!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:23.140
Shut up! He isn't a loser at all!

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:29.310
He's just a guy who thinks positively
 and stumbles recklessly into things!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.480
How stupid!

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:35.700
Shingetsu! I swear I'll win for you, too!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.030
Draw!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:44.580
I drew the Level Three Dotedotengu!

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.750
That is your end, Yuma Tsukumo!

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.420
Disappear!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:53.670
It may be a Level Three Monster, but its Attack Power is...

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.720
...zero!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.260
It has zero Attack Points?!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.600
Yuma, let's go!

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:02.640
Right!

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:04.930
I send Dotedotengu to the Graveyard!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:12.480
And when this guy is sent to the Graveyard, I can return one card on your field to your hand.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:15.860
Blow away that guy's Monster!

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.240
Ultimatrainer's effect activates!

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:23.740
Once per turn, it can't be targeted by Monster Effects!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.210
It's no use!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:28.920
Yuma...

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.710
Looks like you wasted your final shot.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.880
It wasn't wasted!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:38.970
I activate the Trap Card, Burial Mayhem - Bury Panic!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:43.850
For each of our Monsters sent to the Graveyard this turn,

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:47.810
the opposing player receives 100 points of damage!

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:51.730
Then the Attack Power of
 one Monster is lowered by that amount!

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:52.940
What?!

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:56.690
A total of 18 cards entered the Graveyard!

00:18:57.570 --> 00:19:00.490
So for the player and your Monster...

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.080
...1800 damage!

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.540
I end my turn.

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:14.500
Here I go! My turn! Draw!

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:18.220
I summon Gagaga Magician!

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:29.180
And then, I activate the Continuous Magic, Gagaga X Gagaga, from my hand!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:32.980
I select one Gagaga Monster on my field,

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:36.650
and this card is Special Summoned as that same Monster.

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:40.110
I Overlay the two Level Four Gagaga Magicians!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:44.320
I build the Overlay Network with these two Monsters!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.410
Xyz Summon!

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:50.790
Come forth, Number 39!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:52.920
Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.840
You Summoned a Number?!

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:02.840
That's not all! I'm gonna bring it to ya!

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:08.310
With Hope as Overlay Material, I will Chaos Xyz Change!

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:12.480
Come forth, Chaos Number 39!

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:18.280
Spiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:27.240
Then Hope Ray's effect activates!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.950
By detaching one Overlay Unit...

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:33.870
...Hope Ray's Attack Power increases by 500!

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:36.130
Overlay Charge!!

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:41.050
4000 Attack Points?!

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.470
Crazy amazing!

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:45.390
Go, Hope Ray!

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:48.100
Attack Ultimatrainer!

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:51.390
Hope Sword Chaos Slash!!

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:11.580
I did it!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.040
All right!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:17.000
Yuma Tsukumo...!

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:19.040
I swear I'll get you next time!

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:27.300
Huh? Where is this...? What was I doing?

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:30.310
Huh? You don't remember?

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:33.600
As I figured, he was also being controlled.

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:34.770
Yuma!

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:37.060
Yuma!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:41.320
Yuma-<i>kun</i>! Are you okay?

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:43.490
Here, off to the infirmary.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.530
Hey, Shingetsu...

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:45.990
Huh?

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:49.950
I was able to win because of you. Thanks a bunch!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:54.120
Shingetsu, from today on, you're one of the guys!

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:56.000
Yes! It's for the best!

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.790
Wait a minute, Shingetsu!

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:04.420
I've had more than enough of what you think is "best"!

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:24.150
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:31.830
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:39.420
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:46.760
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.300 --> 00:23:03.690
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:18.830
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:27.380
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:32.180
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.480
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:43.060
The Class Rep's become the Student Council Disciplinary Commander?!

00:23:43.060 --> 00:23:46.020
He's going after us for everything! Gimme a break!

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:47.730
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:51.820
"Dueling Is Against School Rules!? Sally Forth! The Special Disciplinary Commander!"

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:54.700
Just watch me bring it to 'em!
